<title>SWEDEN: Volvo Aero in deal with MTU.</title>
<headline>Volvo Aero in deal with MTU.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volvo Aero on Wednesday announced a cooperation agreement with German aeroengine manufacturer MTU Munchen, a subsidiary of Daimler-Benz Aerospace (DASA), worth four billion crowns over about 20 years.</p>
</text>
